#   responses_1 - Fetch::Infrastructure::Response: creation, network errors, the virtual
#   accessors of Responses.h, the response's URL and location URL, cloning, unsafe responses
#   and CORS-same-origin
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Fetch/Infrastructure/HTTP/Responses.cpp (lines 22-222) with
#       the members of Response in Responses.h (lines 62-145). Region r28 ported create, the
#       constructor, visit_edges, url and six accessors for the responses phase 1 makes;
#       region p2b the rest. Response's virtual accessors (FilteredResponse forwards them to
#       its internal response) are dispatchers over FetchResponseVTable, with the bodies here.
